    "chunk_text": "elred & sancte \u00c6\u00feelbyrht. \u00deonne resta\u00f0 on Burh Sanctus Florentius martyr, & sancta Cyneswi\u00f0, & sancta Cyneburh, & monige \u00deonne resta\u00f0 on \u00feornige Sancte Botulf, & sancte A\u00feulf, & sancte Huna, & sancte \u00feancred, & sancte \u00deonne reste\u00f0 on Abbadune Sanctus Uincentius martyr. \u00deonne reste\u00f0 Sanctus Dunstanus arcebisceop, on Cantwara byrig on Cristes cyricean, & fela o\u00f0ra sancta \u00deonne reste\u00f0 Sanctus Paulinus on Hrofe ceastre. \u00deonne reste\u00f0 Sanctus Byrinus se Romaniscea bisceop on Wintanceastre on ealdam mynstre, & sancte \u00deonne resta\u00f0 on niwan mynstre Sanctus Iudocus, & Sanctus Grimbaldus. \u00deonne reste\u00f0 sancta Eadburh on nunnan mynstre. \u00deonne reste\u00f0 Sanctus Oswaldus arcebisceop on Wigera ceastre & fela o\u00f0ra haligra bisceopa mid him. \u00deonne reste\u00f0 sanctus Egwinus bisceop on Eoues hamme neah \u00fe\u00e6re ea Afene. \u00deonne reste\u00f0 sancte Kenelm cynebearn on Winclescumbe. \u00deonne reste\u00fe sanctus M\u00e6ildul, & sanctus Aldhelmus, & Iohann se wisa on Ealdelmes byrig. \u00deonne reste\u00f0 Sancte Iwig & sancta Eadgy\u00f0 on Wiltune. \u00deonne reste\u00f0 sancte Eadweard cyningc & sancta \u00c6lfgyfu on Sceftes byrig. \u00deonne reste\u00fe sanctus Aidanus, & sanctus Patricius on Gl\u00e6stinga byrig & fela o\u00f0ra sancta. \u00deonne reste\u00f0 Sanctus Congarus confessor on Cungres byrig. \u00deonne reste\u00f0 sancta Sidefulla f\u00e6mne wi\u00f0 utan Exanceastre. \u00deonne Rumonus episcopus on T\u00e6fist",
